# AI assistant rules for this project

# Package Manager
- ALWAYS use pnpm. Never use npm or yarn.
- Install command: `pnpm install`
- Add command: `pnpm add <package>`
- Dev command: `pnpm dev`
- Build command: `pnpm build`

# Architecture Guidelines
- Next.js 16 (App Router)
- Tailwind CSS with Shadcn UI (vanilla CSS, CSS variables for theming)
- Supabase for Auth & Config storage
- AWS SDK v3 wrapper in `lib/s3-client.ts` for browser-based direct storage queries
